<title>USA: MainStreet BankGroup to buy Commerce Bank.</title>
<headline>MainStreet BankGroup to buy Commerce Bank.</headline>
<dateline>MARTINSVILLE, Va. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MainStreet BankGroup Inc on Tuesday said it entered a tentative agreement to acquire College Park, Maryland-based Commerce Bank for $14.5 million of stock.</p>
<p>The deal is contingent on all holders of Commerce Bank common and preferred stock warrants accepting the equivalent of $31 per warrant in MainStreet common stock, and all Commerce Bank preferred stock being converted to common stock by the effective time of the transaction, MainStreet said in a statement.</p>
</text>
